# The modifiers mrp accepts on a top-level call: local and volatile, on a
# stage call. A top-level pipeline call takes none ("Pipeline 'P' cannot be
# called with 'local' tag"), a top-level call cannot be preflight, and
# volatile takes only true or false; mro2nf compiles the entry file with
# mrp's compiler, so it refuses those as mrp does (#342). Neither accepted
# modifier changes what the stage gets or publishes.
stage EMIT(
    in  int x,
    out int y,
    src py  "stages/emit",
)

call EMIT(
    x = 1,
) using (
    local    = true,
    volatile = true,
)
